# Production build configuration.
#
# VITE_API_URL is deliberately EMPTY: in production the SPA is served by the
# same Caddy vhost that reverse-proxies /v1, /uploads, etc. to the API, so
# the client uses same-origin relative URLs. Set an absolute origin here only
# for a split-host deployment (and configure PORTAL_CORS_ORIGINS to match).
#
# NOTE: an *unset* (missing) VITE_API_URL makes a production build throw at
# startup (see src/api/baseUrl.ts) — empty-and-present means "same origin".
VITE_API_URL=
